cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Smart2Raw: self-adaptive integer numeric storage (header-only, C)"
abstract: >-
  A header-only C library that stores integer arrays in the smallest native class
  that fits the real range (signed/unsigned 8/16/32/64 bits) and operates directly
  on the compact form: aggregations and SIMD with runtime dispatch, block-wise
  width (PFOR), zero-copy mmap, portable CRC32 I/O, and analytics on the compact data.
type: software
